{
  "job_B23.3.2.1_20251003_114604": {
    "chunk_text": "Luna I qui inciderit, difficile euadet Se \u00fee afeal\u00f0, earfo\u00f0lice he \u00e6twint. Luna II, cito consurget ra\u00f0e he aris\u00fe. Luna III, non eundet he ne \u00e6twint. Luna IIII, laboret et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00f0. Luna V, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00f0. Luna VI, non euadet he ne \u00e6twint. Luna VII, medicina sanabitur mid l\u00e6cedome he bi\u00f0 geh\u00e6led. Luna VIII, diu languet et surget lange he adla\u00f0 and aris\u00f0. Luna IX, languet he adla\u00f0. Luna X diu egrotat lange he sicla\u00f0. Luna XI, periculo periclitat on frecednesse he dyrf\u00f0. Luna XII, surget he aris\u00fe. Luna XIII, alignot tempus egrotat sumne timan he siccla\u00f0. Luna XIIII, laborat et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00fe. Luna XV periclitat he dyrf\u00f0. Luna XVI, locum mitabit et surget stowe he awent and aris\u00f0. Luna XVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00fe. Luna XVIII, laborabit et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00f0. Luna XIX, similiter eallswa. Luna XX, similiter eallswa. Luna XXI, rem adiuuabit \u00f0ingc he fultuma\u00f0. Luna XXII, languet et surget he adla\u00f0 and aris\u00fe. Luna XXIII, similiter eallswa. Luna XXIIII, diu languet lange he adla\u00f0. Luna XXV, languet et morietur adla\u00f0 and he swelt. Luna XXVI, languet he adla\u00f0. Luna XXVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00fe. Luna XXVIII, eger multum iacebit et morietur seoc swi\u00f0e he li\u00f0 and swylt. Luna XXIX, eger euadet seoc \u00e6twint. Luna XXX,",
